OL,3,ANo 10 does not rule out inviting back
OL,4,Ainfluencer at centre of video row
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowning Street has not ruled out
OL,7,Finviting the creator of a video which
OL,8,Fwas branded "not acceptable" by Andy
OL,9,FBurnham to future events at Number 10.
OL,11,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,12,Fcalled on the PM to apologise for
OL,13,F"debasing his office" by allowing Max
OL,14,FBalegde to record a video on the steps
OL,15,Fof Number 10, which included "vile" and
OL,16,F"obscene" comments about women.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
